</head><body><div id="pwaInstallCard"><div class="pwaTitle">📱 BLACKLIST OPERATIV // APP-MODUS</div><div class="pwaSub">Auf iPad/iPhone: Teilen → „Zum Home-Bildschirm“. Danach startet BLACKLIST OPERATIV wie eine App im Vollbild.</div><div class="appBadge">⚡ PWA · OFFLINE CACHE · FULLSCREEN</div><div class="pwaBtns"><button id="pwaHow">ANLEITUNG</button><button id="pwaClose" class="pwaClose">SPÄTER</button></div></div><div id="studioIntro" aria-label="Pad to Home Studios Intro"><div class="introFrame" id="introSceneFrame"><div class="introScene"></div><div class="introSilhouette"></div><div class="introVignette"></div></div><div class="introFrame" id="introGameFrame"><div class="introGrid"></div><div class="introVignette"></div><div class="gameReveal"><div class="present">PAD TO HOME STUDIOS PRÄSENTIERT</div><div class="title">BLACKLIST <span>OPERATIV</span></div><div class="subtitle">MOBILE TACTICAL OPERATIONS</div></div></div></div><audio id="meisterwerkMusic" preload="auto" loop playsinline webkit-playsinline
 style="display:none" aria-hidden="true"></audio><button id="audioToggle" aria-label="Ton an/aus" style="position:fixed;right:10px;top:10px;z-index:9999;background:#101418;color:#fff;border:1px solid #59636a;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 11px;font-weight:700">🔊 TON AN</button><canvas id="game"></canvas><div id="rotateNotice"><div><div style="font-size:50px">📱↔️</div><h2>BITTE QUERFORMAT</h2><p style="color:#89969d">
 BLACKLIST OPERATIV ist für das Spielen im
 Querformat optimiert.
 </p></div></div><div id="menu"><div class="panel"><div class="logo">
 BLACKLIST <span>OPERATIV</span></div><div class="sub">
